钛媒体：OpenAI 将收购开发工具初创公司 Pierre Computer，瞄准微软 GitHub 代码托管业务<br />
<a href="https://www.tmtpost.com/nictation/8193862.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.tmtpost.com/nictation/8193862.html</a><br />
天天基金网：据 Axios，OpenAI 将收购开发工具初创企业 Pierre Computer<br />
