ChainCatcher：OpenAI 拟收购开发工具初创公司 Pierre Computer<br />
<a href="https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2301720" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2301720</a><br />
Infobae：OpenAI 将收购代码存储初创公司，与微软的 GitHub 竞争<br />
<a href="https://www.infobae.com/tecno/2026/11/04/openai-comprara-una-startup-que-almacena-codigo-para-competir-con-github-de-microsoft/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.infobae.com/tecno/2026/11/04/openai-comprara-una-startup-que-almacena-codigo-para-competir-con-github-de-microsoft/</a><br />
Pierre Computer 官方推文：公司公告<br />
<a href="https://x.com/pierrecomputer/status/2117999036175188183" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://x.com/pierrecomputer/status/2117999036175188183</a></p>
</div>
