          <meta itemprop="position" content="17">
          <div class="nf-article" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
            <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-11-05T02:17:04+08:00">
            <div class="nfc-fmeta"><time class="nfc-mono">02:17</time><a class="nfc-badge" href="https://aiproducthub.cn/newsflash/stream/?v=%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E5%9F%BA%E5%BB%BA"><i class="nfc-d" style="background:#64748b"></i>算力基建</a><span class="nfc-co"><span class="nfc-lg" style="background:#4285f4">O</span>OpenAI</span></div>
            <h2 class="nf-article-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://aiproducthub.cn/newsflash/sam-altman-renames-ram-altman-on-x/">奥特曼X改名Ram Altman 玩梗回应内存争议</a></h2>
            <div class="nf-article-content" itemprop="articleBody"><p>时间：2026年11月3日</p>
<p>地点：美国</p>
<p>人物：Sam Altman（OpenAI CEO）</p>
<p>事件详情：OpenAI CEO Sam Altman 在 X（原 <a class="external external" href="https://x.aiproducthub.cn/" title="全球领先的社交媒体平台" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" >Twitter</a>）上将显示名改为 &#8220;Ram Altman&#8221;，以回应此前因 PC 内存（RAM）言论引发的网络争议。一名用户在 X 上建议 &#8220;Can you rename your X to Ram Altman?&#8221;，Altman 回复 &#8220;Ok yeah.&#8221; 并立即更改显示名，同时发文 &#8220;i want you to have so much ram&#8221;。至 11 月 4 日上午 11 时（ET），其 X 显示名已恢复为 &#8220;Sam Altman&#8221;。</p>
<p>背景：Altman 早前在播客 &#8220;Cheeky Pint&#8221; 中表示，个人电脑中的 DRAM 长期闲置，使用率仅约 5%，从全球资源分配角度看 &#8220;quite terrible&#8221;，引发玩家和网友强烈反弹。随着 AI 模型规模扩大，DRAM 供需紧张推高内存价格，PC 厂商和消费者均受影响。</p>
<p>影响：事件在 X 上引发 meme 潮，&#8221;Ram Altman&#8221; 成为热门话题。印度用户将其与排灯节（Diwali）联系，发起 &#8220;Happy Diwali&#8221; 互动。网友批评 Altman 忽视 AI 数据中心对内存的巨额需求才是短缺主因，并指出 OpenAI 自身的 Stargate 项目曾试图锁定全球约 40% 的 DRAM 产能。</p>
<p>总结：Sam Altman 短暂将 X 名称改为 &#8220;Ram Altman&#8221; 是以玩梗方式回应争议的社交互动，48 小时内即恢复原名。事件本身虽无实质政策变化，但再次凸显 AI 产业与消费电子在内存资源分配上的深层矛盾，以及公众对科技巨头资源观的不满。</p>
<p>参考来源：<br />
The Verge<br />
<a href="https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1026292/sam-altman-ram-shortage-pcs-comments" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1026292/sam-altman-ram-shortage-pcs-comments</a></p>
<p>Times of India<br />
<a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/after-backlash-over-pc-memory-remarks-sam-altman-changes-his-name-to-ram-and-says-only-because-/articleshow/135533523.cms" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/after-backlash-over-pc-memory-remarks-sam-altman-changes-his-name-to-ram-and-says-only-because-/articleshow/135533523.cms</a></p>
<p>Mashable India<br />
<a href="https://in.mashable.com/tech/115710/sam-altman-explains-why-he-thinks-people-shouldnt-keep-so-much-ram-in-their-pcs-social-media-reacts" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://in.mashable.com/tech/115710/sam-altman-explains-why-he-thinks-people-shouldnt-keep-so-much-ram-in-their-pcs-social-media-reacts</a></p>
<p>36Kr<br />
<a href="https://eu.36kr.com/en/p/4051772922696581" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://eu.36kr.com/en/p/4051772922696581</a></p>
<p>Yahoo Tech<br />
<a href="https://tech.yahoo.com/ai/articles/sam-altman-joked-ais-thirst-171812437.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://tech.yahoo.com/ai/articles/sam-altman-joked-ais-thirst-171812437.html</a></p>
</div>
          </div>
