<a href="https://global.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202610/31/WS6ae54463e4b06d4aa0566359.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://global.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202610/31/WS6ae54463e4b06d4aa0566359.html</a></p>
