<a href="https://investor.wedbush.com/wedbush/article/gnwcq-2026-11-3-amd-reports-third-quarter-2026-financial-results" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://investor.wedbush.com/wedbush/article/gnwcq-2026-11-3-amd-reports-third-quarter-2026-financial-results</a></p>
