              <div class="nf-daily-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
          <meta itemprop="position" content="35">
          <div class="nf-article" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
            <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-11-05T05:11:52+08:00">
            <div class="nfc-fmeta"><time class="nfc-mono">05:11</time><a class="nfc-badge" href="https://aiproducthub.cn/newsflash/stream/?v=%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E5%9F%BA%E5%BB%BA"><i class="nfc-d" style="background:#64748b"></i>算力基建</a><span class="nfc-co"><span class="nfc-lg is-img"><img src="https://aiproducthub.cn/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/20251210132913-a038a.jpeg" alt="微软" loading="lazy"></span>微软</span></div>
            <h2 class="nf-article-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://aiproducthub.cn/newsflash/microsoft-windows-ai-pc-roadmap-four-tiers-8gb-entry/">微软Win11 AI PC路线图曝光 4档门槛8GB可入</a></h2>
            <div class="nf-article-content" itemprop="articleBody"><p>时间：2026年11月3日</p>
<p>地点：美国</p>
<p>人物：硬件爆料者HXL（@9550pro）与微软</p>
<p>事件详情：一份题为“Windows是混合智能之家”的路线图幻灯片在<a class="external external" href="https://x.aiproducthub.cn/" title="全球领先的社交媒体平台" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" >X平台</a>曝光，显示微软将Windows AI PC按内存和本地AI算力划分为Tier 0至Tier 3四个层级。Tier 0为入门级，8GB内存起步，搭载英特尔酷睿3/4系列、AMD锐龙100/200系列及骁龙X/X Plus处理器，仅处理基础本地AI任务，重度计算依赖云端。Tier 1对应16GB至64GB内存的Copilot+ PC，可处理设备端AI问答、智能体任务和长时间运行工作负载。Tier 2面向开发者与创作者，128GB及以上内存，支持本地构建和运行AI模型。Tier 3为AI超级计算机，配备超过128GB内存及专业加速硬件，用于本地运行前沿大模型。</p>
<p>背景：微软早在2026年10月7日于旧金山举办的发布会上便提出“混合智能”（Hybrid Intelligence）理念，主张通过混合架构结合云端AI与本地计算能力处理用户任务。此次曝光的路线图是对该理念的进一步细化，首次给出了明确的硬件分级标准。</p>
<p>影响：新分级将8GB内存PC纳入AI PC范畴，意味着即便没有高内存和顶级NPU，普通用户仍可通过云端获得AI能力，显著降低AI PC准入门槛。同时，路线图还披露了英特尔Crescent Island推理GPU、AMD下一代锐龙AI 500 Medusa Point、英伟达RTX Spark及GB300 DGX Station等尚未正式发布的产品代号，为行业供应链和消费者选购提供了早期参考。</p>
<p>总结：目前该路线图尚未获得微软官方确认，但它清晰勾勒了微软未来AI PC的硬件分层策略：从8GB入门设备到128GB以上个人超算，覆盖不同需求的用户与开发者。随着明年多款未发布处理器面世，Windows AI PC的规格门槛有望进一步明确。</p>
<p>参考来源：<br />
快科技<br />
<a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/LASRTHFD0511CPVM.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.163.com/dy/article/LASRTHFD0511CPVM.html</a></p>
<p>IT之家<br />
<a href="https://www.sohu.com/a/1096862638_114760" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.sohu.com/a/1096862638_114760</a></p>
<p>驱动中国<br />
<a href="https://app.qudong.com/article/528465.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://app.qudong.com/article/528465.html</a></p>
<p>Yahoo Tech<br />
<a href="https://tech.yahoo.com/ai/copilot/articles/think-8gb-windows-pc-too-133723007.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://tech.yahoo.com/ai/copilot/articles/think-8gb-windows-pc-too-133723007.html</a></p>
<p>KOCPC</p>
<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="uGiHqwPsYg"><p><a href="https://en.kocpc.com.tw/archives/26791" target="_blank"  rel="nofollow noopener"  class="external" >Microsoft&#8217;s next-generation Windows AI PC specifications revealed! There are four tiers in total; 8GB is just entry-level, while the professional tier starts at 128GB.</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="“Microsoft’s next-generation Windows AI PC specifications revealed! There are four tiers in total; 8GB is just entry-level, while the professional tier starts at 128GB.” — King of Computer Media" src="https://en.kocpc.com.tw/archives/26791/embed#?secret=RiFaEklnDX#?secret=uGiHqwPsYg" data-secret="uGiHqwPsYg" width="500" height="282" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>
<p>Windows Central<br />
<a href="https://www.windowscentral.com/microsoft/windows-11/microsofts-ai-future-has-room-for-everything-from-8gb-windows-pcs-to-supercomputers-running-frontier-models" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.windowscentral.com/microsoft/windows-11/microsofts-ai-future-has-room-for-everything-from-8gb-windows-pcs-to-supercomputers-running-frontier-models</a></p>
