<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="BX2wb7rz8x"><p><a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/04/meta-acquires-ai-coding-startup-conductor/" target="_blank"  rel="nofollow noopener"  class="external" >Meta acquires AI coding startup Conductor</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="“Meta acquires AI coding startup Conductor” — TechCrunch" src="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/04/meta-acquires-ai-coding-startup-conductor/embed/#?secret=xB9lsKm7Sd#?secret=BX2wb7rz8x" data-secret="BX2wb7rz8x" width="500" height="282" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>
