<a href="https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/2026-11-04/doc-inixpvva1698352.shtml" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/2026-11-04/doc-inixpvva1698352.shtml</a></p>
<p>InfoQ AI教AI开车！百度首次披露Apollo World世界模型，让无人驾驶突破不可能三角<br />
<a href="https://www.infoq.cn/news/tIt75FRqU2hwy4eWrOIu" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.infoq.cn/news/tIt75FRqU2hwy4eWrOIu</a></p>
<p>香港文汇报 AI教AI開車！百度首次披露Apollo World具身世界模型<br />
