<a href="https://newsroom.ibm.com/2026-10-27-ibm-introduces-identity-and-control-for-ai-agents,-securing-frontier-intelligence-for-the-enterprise" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://newsroom.ibm.com/2026-10-27-ibm-introduces-identity-and-control-for-ai-agents,-securing-frontier-intelligence-for-the-enterprise</a></p>
