<a href="https://au.finance.yahoo.com/news/coherent-nyse-cohr-beats-q3-212313083.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://au.finance.yahoo.com/news/coherent-nyse-cohr-beats-q3-212313083.html</a></p>
