<p>The Standard<br />
<a href="https://www.thestandard.com.hk/finance/article/347440/Meta-raises-US15-billion-in-five-part-US-bond-sale-to-fund-AI-expansion" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.thestandard.com.hk/finance/article/347440/Meta-raises-US15-billion-in-five-part-US-bond-sale-to-fund-AI-expansion</a></p>
<p>Yahoo Finance<br />
<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/meta-goes-europe-debt-raising-195334046.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/meta-goes-europe-debt-raising-195334046.html</a></p>
