<a href="https://huggingface.co/nvidia/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-NVFP4" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://huggingface.co/nvidia/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-NVFP4</a><br />
