<p>Yahoo Finance<br />
<a href="https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/oracle-cancels-7-bln-chip-055216451.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/oracle-cancels-7-bln-chip-055216451.html</a></p>
<p>Times of India<br />
<a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/oracle-dumps-7-billion-with-one-of-chinas-biggest-it-company-after-the-us-government-reportedly-tells-the-company-you-cannot-/articleshow/135531700.cms" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/oracle-dumps-7-billion-with-one-of-chinas-biggest-it-company-after-the-us-government-reportedly-tells-the-company-you-cannot-/articleshow/135531700.cms</a></p>
<p>BW Businessworld<br />
