<a href="https://tech.ifeng.com/c/8xn2mV6ZIwM" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://tech.ifeng.com/c/8xn2mV6ZIwM</a><br />
通信世界：小艺Work首发openPangu-2.1-Pro，盘古模型下探个人办公<br />
<a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAUKFIA5051288FS.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAUKFIA5051288FS.html</a><br />
