<a href="https://www.d1ev.com/newsflash/315764" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.d1ev.com/newsflash/315764</a><br />
Pandaily：华为小艺Work首发运行openPangu-2.1-Pro，主打鸿蒙任务增强<br />
<a href="https://pandaily.com/huawei-xiaoyi-work-openpangu-2-1-pro-harmonyos-task-enhancement-agent" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://pandaily.com/huawei-xiaoyi-work-openpangu-2-1-pro-harmonyos-task-enhancement-agent</a><br />
Pandaily：华为云MaaS将下架openPangu-2.0模型<br />
<a href="https://pandaily.com/huawei-cloud-maas-openpangu-2-0-flash-pro-offline-nov-30-deepseek-v4-1-flash-glm-5-3" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://pandaily.com/huawei-cloud-maas-openpangu-2-0-flash-pro-offline-nov-30-deepseek-v4-1-flash-glm-5-3</a></p>
