Economic Times：Microsoft rejects multibillion-dollar AI deal with UK&#8217;s Nscale<br />
<a href="https://m.economictimes.com/tech/artificial-intelligence/microsoft-rejects-multibillion-dollar-ai-deal-with-uks-nscale/amp_articleshow/135560817.cms" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://m.economictimes.com/tech/artificial-intelligence/microsoft-rejects-multibillion-dollar-ai-deal-with-uks-nscale/amp_articleshow/135560817.cms</a><br />
