网易：微软拒绝扩大得州数据中心算力租赁 Nscale350亿美元上市计划面临考验<br />
<a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAVR97A305568W0A.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAVR97A305568W0A.html</a></p>
