<a href="https://www.rdworldonline.com/openai-says-gpt-6-astra-designed-a-talking-codex-pet-manufacturing-took-several-rounds/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.rdworldonline.com/openai-says-gpt-6-astra-designed-a-talking-codex-pet-manufacturing-took-several-rounds/</a></p>
