<a href="https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/databases/whats-new-across-googles-agentic-data-cloud" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/databases/whats-new-across-googles-agentic-data-cloud</a></p>
