              <div class="nf-daily-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
          <meta itemprop="position" content="122">
          <div class="nf-article" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
            <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-11-05T18:57:06+08:00">
            <div class="nfc-fmeta"><time class="nfc-mono">18:57</time><a class="nfc-badge" href="https://aiproducthub.cn/newsflash/stream/?v=%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><i class="nfc-d" style="background:#dc2626"></i>安全事件</a></div>
            <h2 class="nf-article-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://aiproducthub.cn/newsflash/nysba-issues-ai-ethics-guidelines-lawyers/">纽约州律师协会发布AI使用伦理准则</a></h2>
            <div class="nf-article-content" itemprop="articleBody"><p>时间：2026年11月3日</p>
<p>地点：美国纽约州</p>
<p>人物：纽约州律师协会（NYSBA）人工智能与新兴技术委员会</p>
<p>事件详情：纽约州律师协会下属人工智能与新兴技术委员会正式发布《律师人工智能使用法律伦理指南》。该指南明确，律师使用人工智能工具节省的时间不得向客户收费，学习使用AI工具的时间同样不能计费。购买和维护AI软件的成本原则上属于事务所间接费用，只有在与具体客户案件直接挂钩并提前告知客户的情况下，才能作为杂费收取。对于仅用于行政管理的AI使用（如文字处理、拼写检查、日程安排、计时），若不影响收费金额，律师一般无需向客户披露。指南同时提醒律师注意训练数据偏见、客户信息保密等风险，并强调督导律师仍需对下属的合规性负责。</p>
<p>背景：生成式AI正在深刻改变法律行业的运作方式。纽约州律师协会早在2024年便成立人工智能任务force，此次发布的指南是对前期工作的延续和细化。纽约州职业行为规则（New York Rules of Professional Conduct）仍是评估律师AI使用的核心基准。</p>
<p>影响：该指南为美国律师行业使用AI工具设定了明确的伦理边界，涉及计费、客户告知、数据保密和监管责任等多个维度。其他州的律师协会可能参考纽约州的做法，出台类似规范。</p>
<p>总结：纽约州律师协会此次发布的AI伦理指南，核心是禁止将AI节省的时间变现收费，并要求将AI软件成本纳入事务所间接费用管理。随着生成式AI在法律行业的渗透率提升，类似的职业伦理规范预计将在更多司法辖区落地。</p>
<p>参考来源：<br />
ABA Journal报道<br />
<a href="https://www.abajournal.com/news/article/ny-bar-tells-lawyers-not-to-bill-for-time-saved-by-ai" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.abajournal.com/news/article/ny-bar-tells-lawyers-not-to-bill-for-time-saved-by-ai</a></p>
<p>Westfair Communications报道</p>
<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="bYcjKrJlQ3"><p><a href="https://westfaironline.com/artificial-intelligence/guidelines-on-artificial-intelligence-issued-for-lawyers/" target="_blank"  rel="nofollow noopener"  class="external" >Guidelines on artificial intelligence issued for lawyers</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="“Guidelines on artificial intelligence issued for lawyers” — Westfair Communications" src="https://westfaironline.com/artificial-intelligence/guidelines-on-artificial-intelligence-issued-for-lawyers/embed/#?secret=UKBoOSRRv6#?secret=bYcjKrJlQ3" data-secret="bYcjKrJlQ3" width="500" height="282" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>
<p>Stephen Honig法律博客评论</p>
<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="2XTqoYEaS9"><p><a href="https://stephenhoniglawblog.com/the-law/bar-association-mistrusts-lawyers/" target="_blank"  rel="nofollow noopener"  class="external" >Bar Association Mistrusts Lawyers?</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="“Bar Association Mistrusts Lawyers?” — The Law and Other Anomalies" src="https://stephenhoniglawblog.com/the-law/bar-association-mistrusts-lawyers/embed/#?secret=Nn4miYpl8C#?secret=2XTqoYEaS9" data-secret="2XTqoYEaS9" width="500" height="282" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>
<p>NYSBA官方AI指南页面</p>
<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="JvfbENxkJL"><p><a href="https://nysba.org/new-guidelines-for-using-ai-to-aid-civil-legal-service-organizations/" target="_blank"  rel="nofollow noopener"  class="external" >New Guidelines for Using AI To Aid Civil Legal Service Organizations</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="“New Guidelines for Using AI To Aid Civil Legal Service Organizations” — New York State Bar Association" src="https://nysba.org/new-guidelines-for-using-ai-to-aid-civil-legal-service-organizations/embed/#?secret=xbUfKG5cv7#?secret=JvfbENxkJL" data-secret="JvfbENxkJL" width="500" height="282" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>
