<a href="https://eu.36kr.com/en/p/4056259001815944" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://eu.36kr.com/en/p/4056259001815944</a></p>
<p>Coherent Corp. via Valuespectrum/GlobeNewswire<br />
<a href="https://www.valuespectrum.com/corporate_news/1521898-coherent-corp-reports-first-quarter-fiscal-2027-results" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.valuespectrum.com/corporate_news/1521898-coherent-corp-reports-first-quarter-fiscal-2027-results</a></p>
