<a href="https://thenextweb.com/news/fal-1-3b-bessemer-16b-valuation-ai-inference" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://thenextweb.com/news/fal-1-3b-bessemer-16b-valuation-ai-inference</a></p>
