<a href="https://www.guandian.cn/article/20261105/623670.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.guandian.cn/article/20261105/623670.html</a></p>
<p>cnBeta：Meta高管称“人口崩塌”之下 AI提升生产力至关重要<br />
<a href="https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585042.htm" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585042.htm</a></p>
