<p>粤港澳都市网 腾讯健康医疗全场景<br />
<a href="https://www.ygacity.com/news/20261030/27299.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.ygacity.com/news/20261030/27299.html</a></p>
<p>网易 腾讯健康发布医疗AI Agent工具箱<br />
<a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAGLRF2J0539ABYY.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAGLRF2J0539ABYY.html</a></p>
<p>科学网 虚拟细胞算法UniPert-G2CP<br />
<a href="https://medical.sciencenet.cn/sbhtmlnews/2026/8/371925.shtm" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://medical.sciencenet.cn/sbhtmlnews/2026/8/371925.shtm</a></p>
<p>医药魔方 不少药企加紧部署腾讯WorkBuddy<br />
