<p>UA.NEWS英文报道：北爱尔兰将适用单独的欧盟AI规则（2026年11月4日）<br />
<a href="https://ua.news/en/technologies/u-pivnichnii-irlandiyi-diiatimut-okremi-pravila-es-shchodo-shi-bbc-news" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://ua.news/en/technologies/u-pivnichnii-irlandiyi-diiatimut-okremi-pravila-es-shchodo-shi-bbc-news</a></p>
