<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="Zg9orw3TOY"><p><a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/dropbox-acquires-tigris-data-for-350m-to-bolster-its-ai-iinfrastructure/" target="_blank"  rel="nofollow noopener"  class="external" >Dropbox acquires Tigris Data for $350M to bolster its AI infrastructure</a></p></blockquote>
